1: Sun Jan 12 00:00:00 PST 1997
Name: monolith
Number of extra information: 3
0: 1
1: 4
2: 9
Name: monolith
Number of extra information: 2
0: 1,4,9
1: dimensions
Name: monolith
Number of extra information: 2
0: dimensions are
1: 1,4,9
